    (0, None, '\'Salt the meat exactly in seven minutes.\' "Soli" is both "salt" the command and, nearly, the noun, "sol\'". "Cherez sem\' minut" is "in seven minutes", literally "through seven minutes", and the number comes first.'),
    (1, None, '\'Then our meat will be much more tender.\' "Nezhneye" is "more tender", and the "-eye" is the same one as in "faster". "Namnogo" is "by much", and goes right before the "more". Max used "togda", "then", in "then I\'m off".'),
